    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Да, я вас слушаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I am listening to you.' Notice how 'yes' sets up the clause and leads naturally into 'I'm listening'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Где они? В холодильнике?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
